{"title":"Summer Queen","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 52 Fae that attacks with shock (ranged).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">shock</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/fae-bowstring\">Fae Bowstring</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>What it can drop</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7e9a75620c367eafc936.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"width:28px;height:28px;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:6px\"><a href=\"#/item/summer-scepter-staff\"><b>Summer Scepter</b></a> <span class=\"muted\">(unique Shagbark Staff, bound)</span>: <b>2%</b> of kills (1 in 50), <b>10%</b> from an elite (1 in 10). <span class=\"muted\">10% of damage spells stun the primary target for 1 second. Counts as a 9 carat staff enchant for spells of every school. The stun lasts half as long on players.</span></li>\n      <li><b>Gear every kill:</b> a piece from its tier, excellent or better, and a second piece 1 kill in 5.</li>\n      <li><b>Gold</b> worth about 5 ordinary kills.</li>\n      <li><b>Enchanted:</b> 1 kill in 100 enchants a piece (up to 9c, and only what its material can hold).</li>\n      <li><b>Elite:</b> a boss spawns elite 1 time in 100, and an elite makes its unique 5 times as likely.</li></ul>\n      <p class=\"muted\">From the game’s rules and its own guide. See <a href=\"#/guide/unique-items\">Unique items</a>.</p>\n      <h2>Drops players have recorded</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 10 recorded drops, 578 total, 44–74 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×44–74</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"fae-mote\" title=\"Fae Mote - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e330886da6237ae5ac02.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fae Mote</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"dragonhide-feet\" title=\"Dragonhide Feet - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3d45df5330ab70a2d5c7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dragonhide Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-2139.5px,-5108.1px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/7/19.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:4864px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/7/20.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:1792px;top:5120px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/8/19.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2048px;top:4864px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/8/20.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2048px;top:5120px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/9/19.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2304px;top:4864px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/9/20.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:2304px;top:5120px\"><i style=\"left:2139.5px;top:5108.1px\"></i></div></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>in the wilds around 2246, 1468 <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"summer-queen\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/the-summer-queen\"><img src=\"data/img/6455a2fc64d11c946ff5.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>The Summer Queen</b><span>Lv 52</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Fae: <a href=\"#/monster/fairy\">Fairy</a> <span class=\"muted\">(10)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/fae\">Fae</a> <span class=\"muted\">(15)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/gossamer-knight\">Gossamer Knight</a> <span class=\"muted\">(46)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/glamourweaver\">Glamourweaver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(48)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/8e7e8111ae662592979f.webp\" alt=\"Summer Queen\"></div><h3>Summer Queen</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>52 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 52–52)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Fae</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>shock · ranged</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>330</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>33.1</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2600</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.2 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}